+
+Once Sovereign Gitea is active, publish the Execution Environment image:
+
+```bash
+# Trust Sovereign Gitea CA certificate for this registry endpoint (host:port)
+sudo mkdir -p /etc/containers/certs.d/10.17.250.28:3000
+sudo cp ~/.config/gitea/certs/gitea.crt /etc/containers/certs.d/10.17.250.28:3000/ca.crt
