+
+| Exit Code | Cause |
+| :--- | :--- |
+| `0` | Success: Graph compiled and output directories written. |
+| `1` | Failure: Invalid frontmatter or non-readable source directory. |
+| `2` | Failure: Syntax error or disk full. |
