+### Step 6: Automated Fleet Remediation Using Ansible Playbooks (Part A2)
+
+Declarative playbook: `remediate_oval_fleet.yml`.
+
+{% raw %}
+```yaml
+---
+- name: "Enterprise OVAL Errata Fleet Remediation (Part A2)"
+  hosts: fleet
+  serial: 1
+  gather_facts: true
+  become: true
+
+  vars:
